to  circumvent its own cancellation  a real-world reflection of the main  character's slippery and resilient  nature  fox acts the series after three seasons  but netflix picked it up for two more  amid fan outcry  though the series was meant to close  after its 75th episode another  unlikely renewal revived it talk about  the devil's own luck  check out one of our newest videos right  here plus even more looper videos about  your favorite comic characters are  coming soon  subscribe to our youtube channel and hit  the bell so you don't miss a single one
 

